</header><!-- ── Services ── -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="section-label">What We Do</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Services Built for Real Results</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Every service we offer is tied to measurable outcomes — no vanity metrics, just meaningful growth.</p>

