</section>

<!-- ── Why Us ── -->
<section id="why">
  <div class="section-label">Why Haroon Digital Lab</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">What Sets Us Apart</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">We don't believe in generic playbooks. Every client engagement starts with listening, then strategy, then execution.</p>

  <div class="why-grid">
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-number">01</div>
      <h3>Strategy Before Tactics</h3>
      <p>Before running a single ad or publishing a post, we define clear objectives and build a roadmap aligned to your revenue goals.</p>
